        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15075\">PR #15075</a> from <code>alexcrichton:self-borrow</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This commit updates the tracking of handles within a store added in #14732 to additionally account for <code>borrow</code> handles that don't create a component model resource but end up sill consuming host resources. These handles are now charged to the overall store handle count to ensure that the host-side tracking is limited.</p>\n<p>Part of <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-6fr9-xmw9-5352\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-6fr9-xmw9-5352</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
